{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/95956b08a0c3856c8b62330ae2177b55.avif?t=1767860159\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras_big/95956b08a0c3856c8b62330ae2177b55.webp?t=1767860159 width=1560 height=313 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Towns of Yore is a relaxing third-person city-builder situated on enchanting sky islands. Manage resources, create ecosystems, and build a thriving environment for your cheerful and curious inhabitants. Plan, care, grow, and watch your fantasy town come to life!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/165a38ebcaa17faf14b821fcfdd403a8.avif?t=1767860159\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras_big/165a38ebcaa17faf14b821fcfdd403a8.webp?t=1767860159 width=1560 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct everything from modest homes to impressive landmarks like taverns, farms, and observatories. Each building unlocks new opportunities for growth, transforming your town into a lively, thriving community. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/dedcada02543e22ba25d3dd9865ff5f9.poster.avif?t=1767860159\" width=800 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/dedcada02543e22ba25d3dd9865ff5f9.webm?t=1767860159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/dedcada02543e22ba25d3dd9865ff5f9.mp4?t=1767860159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/296a2a99eb773d9f68b3d8746eee6f9e.avif?t=1767860159\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras_big/296a2a99eb773d9f68b3d8746eee6f9e.webp?t=1767860159 width=1560 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, earn money, and spend research points to unlock new workstations and advancements. Strategically manage your research to determine in what order you expand your product line and town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/326bb3670c3f04b6e5dcfb5c2b9e9fcd.poster.avif?t=1767860159\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/326bb3670c3f04b6e5dcfb5c2b9e9fcd.webm?t=1767860159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/326bb3670c3f04b6e5dcfb5c2b9e9fcd.mp4?t=1767860159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/100e0670698eed6945c57e4be7c84433.avif?t=1767860159\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras_big/100e0670698eed6945c57e4be7c84433.webp?t=1767860159 width=1560 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build efficient production chains by connecting workstations, assigning couriers, and laying down roads to streamline travel. Automate processes and optimize workflows, but keep your inhabitants happy to ensure everything runs smoothly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/13c45ca78a797bd7d4d14cda2e5fd95b.poster.avif?t=1767860159\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/13c45ca78a797bd7d4d14cda2e5fd95b.webm?t=1767860159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/13c45ca78a797bd7d4d14cda2e5fd95b.mp4?t=1767860159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/fab688e69a2bdb79fa34960f322b2666.avif?t=1767860159\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras_big/fab688e69a2bdb79fa34960f322b2666.webp?t=1767860159 width=1560 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your inhabitants' homes with cozy touches like windows, plants, and lights to enhance the atmosphere and entertainment value on your island. The happier your inhabitants are, the more attractive your town becomes, drawing in even more visitors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1669380/extras/4a205505ac1a55aeb791f6245909b037.avif?t=17678601